{"id":"c7287f9e62abafc5","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-tree11-strong-subtree.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Strong Subtree","display":"df-zfc-tree11-strong-subtree — ZFC Tree11 Strong Subtree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-strong-subtree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-strong-subtree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-strong-subtree — ZFC Tree11 Strong Subtree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[./58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-strong-subtree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-strong-subtree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-strong-subtree — ZFC Tree11 Strong Subtree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"336078cd2c28561e\" href=\"?note=336078cd2c28561e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"091259c83b563d39\" href=\"?note=091259c83b563d39\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,L\\in V\">\\(S,T,L\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"336078cd2c28561e\" href=\"?note=336078cd2c28561e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\\)</span> is the level-ordinal relation from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"091259c83b563d39\" href=\"?note=091259c83b563d39\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is inherited through the tree-height atom</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11StrongSubtree}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11StrongSubtree}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T\\times T:u\\subseteq v\\}\">\\(R=\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T\\times T:u\\subseteq v\\}\\)</span>；这是由参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 唯一确定的集合关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}strong\\text{-}subtree}\n\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11StrongSubtree}_S(S,T,L)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\n\\land S\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land L=\\{\\alpha\\in V\\mid \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\exists s\\in S\\;\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(s,\\alpha)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad {}\\land\n\\forall s\\in S\\;\\forall\\beta,\\alpha\\in L\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(s,\\beta)\n\\land\\beta\\in\\alpha\n\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\gamma\\in L\\;(\\beta\\in\\gamma\\land\\gamma\\in\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\n\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\Bigl(\ns\\subsetneq u\n\\land\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(u,\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\})\n\\to\n\\exists!v\\in S\\;\n(u\\subseteq v\\land\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(v,\\alpha))\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}strong\\text{-}subtree}\n\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11StrongSubtree}_S(S,T,L)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\n\\land S\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land L=\\{\\alpha\\in V\\mid \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\exists s\\in S\\;\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(s,\\alpha)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad {}\\land\n\\forall s\\in S\\;\\forall\\beta,\\alpha\\in L\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(s,\\beta)\n\\land\\beta\\in\\alpha\n\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\gamma\\in L\\;(\\beta\\in\\gamma\\land\\gamma\\in\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\n\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\Bigl(\ns\\subsetneq u\n\\land\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(u,\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\})\n\\to\n\\exists!v\\in S\\;\n(u\\subseteq v\\land\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(v,\\alpha))\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>At each successive selected level, every immediate successor in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> has exactly one extension in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>; this is the standard strong-subtree condition for trees of sequences.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md","status":"resolved","id":"336078cd2c28561e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md","status":"resolved","id":"091259c83b563d39","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[./58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md","status":"resolved","id":"336078cd2c28561e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md","status":"resolved","id":"091259c83b563d39","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)$ is the level-ordinal relation from [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T,L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11StrongSubtree}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"R=\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T\\times T:u\\subseteq v\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}strong\\text{-}subtree}\n\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11StrongSubtree}_S(S,T,L)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\quad\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\n\\land S\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land L=\\{\\alpha\\in V\\mid \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\exists s\\in S\\;\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(s,\\alpha)\\}\\\\\n&\\quad {}\\land\n\\forall s\\in S\\;\\forall\\beta,\\alpha\\in L\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(s,\\beta)\n\\land\\beta\\in\\alpha\n\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\gamma\\in L\\;(\\beta\\in\\gamma\\land\\gamma\\in\\alpha)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\n\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\Bigl(\ns\\subsetneq u\n\\land\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(u,\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\})\n\\to\n\\exists!v\\in S\\;\n(u\\subseteq v\\land\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(v,\\alpha))\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":2029,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3801","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree11-strong-subtree.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-strong-subtree]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78","336078cd2c28561e","091259c83b563d39"]}